Done. Here's what changed:

**`server/ambient-agent/agent.ts`**
- Added `private lastLocationReceivedAt: number | null = null` field
- `handleBatch()`: replaced `this.state.currentLocation = msg.location ?? null` with staleness-aware logic:
  - Batch **has** location → update `currentLocation` + record `lastLocationReceivedAt`
  - Batch **no location**, last received **<5min ago** → preserve current location
  - Batch **no location**, last received **>5min ago** (or never) → null `currentLocation` + log
- `handleWatchStatus()` disconnect path: also resets `lastLocationReceivedAt = null`

**`server/ambient-agent/agent-location-staleness.test.ts`** (new, 8 tests)
Covers: set on presence, stay null with no prior, preserve when fresh, clear when stale, exact boundary, timer reset on new location, immediate clear on disconnect, accept fresh location after reconnect.
